{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "product-catalog-test-collection",
		"name": "FoodTech Kitchen - Product Catalog Tests (HU-006)",
		"description": "Comprehensive test collection for Product Catalog Management API endpoints.\n\n**Features Tested:**\n- Create new products (POST)\n- Retrieve product by ID (GET by ID)\n- List all products with filters (GET with query params)\n- Update product details (PUT)\n- Update product availability (PATCH)\n- Delete products (DELETE - idempotent)\n\n**Business Rules Validated:**\n- Product name uniqueness\n- Price must be positive\n- Preparation time must be positive\n- Product type validation (DRINK, HOT_DISH, COLD_DISH)\n- Proper HTTP status codes (201, 200, 204, 400, 404, 409)\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n1. Application running on localhost:8080\n2. H2 database configured (default setup)\n3. No authentication required (or configure bearer token if auth is enabled)\n\n**Test Execution Order:**\n1. Run \"1. Create Products\" folder to populate catalog\n2. Run \"2. Retrieve Products\" folder to test GET endpoints\n3. Run \"3. Update Products\" folder to test PUT/PATCH\n4. Run \"4. Error Scenarios\" folder to validate error handling\n5. Run \"5. Delete Products\" folder to test DELETE (run last)\n\n**Variables:**\n- `api_base_url`: API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080)\n- `product_id_1`, `product_id_2`, `product_id_3`: Saved product IDs from creation",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Create Products",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create Product - Coca Cola (DRINK)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 201 Created\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has product ID\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.id).to.be.a('number');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"product_id_1\", jsonData.id);",
									"    console.log(\"✅ Product ID saved:\", jsonData.id);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Product name is correct\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.name).to.eql(\"Coca Cola\");",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Product type is DRINK\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.type).to.eql(\"DRINK\");",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Product is available by default\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.available).to.be.true;",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response includes timestamps\", function () {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.createdAt).to.exist;",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.updatedAt).to.exist;",
									"});",
									"",
									"console.log(\"✅ SUCCESS: Coca Cola product created\");"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
